---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ProjectFeature from '../components/ProjectFeature.astro';
import { profile, mileage } from '../data/portfolio';
---
<Layout title="박규태 | 수학, 통계, 그리고 구현" description={profile.description}>
  <section class="portfolio-intro">
    <div class="hero-copy hero-reveal">
      <a class="hero-person" href="/about/" aria-label="박규태 소개 보기">
        <img src="/avatar.webp" alt="" width="44" height="44" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
        <span><strong>{profile.name}</strong><small>수학·통계를 공부하고, 현실의 문제를 모델과 코드로 구현합니다.</small></span>
        <b aria-hidden="true">소개 →</b>
      </a>
      <p class="hero-kicker"><span></span> Mathematics · Statistics · Computing</p>
      <h1>현실의 질문을<br /><em>수학의 언어로.</em></h1>
      <p class="intro-description">문제를 모델로 바꾸고, 코드로 실험합니다.<br class="desktop-break" /> 그 과정의 가설과 실패, 발견을 기록합니다.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button-primary" href="/projects/">프로젝트 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/blog/">글 읽기 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="interest-list hero-reveal hero-reveal-delay" aria-label="현재 관심 분야">
      <p class="interest-heading">Exploring</p>
      <ol>
        <li><a href="/blog/?q=algebra">Algebra <span>↗</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog/?q=probability">Probability <span>↗</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog/?q=optimization">Optimization <span>↗</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog/?q=cryptography">Cryptography <span>↗</span></a></li>
      </ol>
    </aside>
  </section>
  <section class="portfolio-section" aria-labelledby="projects-heading">
    <div class="section-heading numbered-heading"><span class="section-number">01</span><div><p>Selected Projects</p><h2 id="projects-heading">직접 만든 것들</h2></div></div>
    <ProjectFeature />
  </section>
  <section class="portfolio-section" aria-labelledby="writing-heading">
    <div class="section-heading numbered-heading"><span class="section-number">02</span><div><p>Recent Notes</p><h2 id="writing-heading">프로젝트 기록</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">모든 글 →</a></div>
    <a class="writing-preview" href={mileage.article}>
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Yonsei Mileage · 개발과 검증</p><h3>예측은 훨씬 정확해졌는데, 왜 더 나쁜 배분이 나왔을까?</h3><p>수강신청에서 출발해 확률 모델, 최적화, 실제 결과 검증으로 이어진 과정.</p></div>
      <span class="writing-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</Layout>
